                <zone h='2429' id='666' name='Traffic/Intersection Control' pane-specification-id='0' param='[federated.1nycifj0740cz21bnjbpr1lvp2dd].[none:TRAFFIC_DEVICE_FUNCTIONING:nk]' type-v2='color' w='8770' x='46403' y='37486'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='19753' id='640' type-v2='text' w='35945' x='61571' y='34895'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Problem</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>There is a high volume of accidents that occur when there are no </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>traffic controls </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>and </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>no divider</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'> for a lane present. Also, about 2/3 of the traffic controls </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>do not work</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Action</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>Incorporate traffic controls and lane dividers in areas that has a large number of accidents to drastically reduce frequency of accidents. Inspect existing traffic controls and see why they may not be working.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11682' id='575' type-v2='text' w='59087' x='2484' y='54648'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Problem</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>These are the </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>streets</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'> that </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>have a large volume</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'> of accidents. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Action</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>Investgate these streets to discover root causes of accidents and to engineer solutions that can prevent future accidents.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='11682' id='571' is-fixed='true' name='High Risk Areas' w='35945' x='61571' y='54648'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='22155' id='426' is-fixed='true' name='Why did it happen?' w='59191' x='2484' y='66330'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='22155' id='605' type-v2='text' w='35841' x='61675' y='66330'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Problem</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>A large number of the accidents recorded are </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>Unknown </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>or</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'> NA. </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>Otherwise</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>, </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>failing to yield right of way</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>, </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>tailgaiting</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>, </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>and</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>speeding</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>on</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>a</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>clear</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>day during the</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>day</run>
                    <run fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>seem to be the primary reasons why there are accidents.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Action</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>Place traffic signals and controls in problem areas to ensure effective communication to drivers to properly yield and maintain a safe driving speed.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>When recording accidents to properly categorize them to ensure accurate analysis. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='219' h='7801' id='364' is-fixed='true' name='When did it happen?' w='59194' x='2484' y='88485'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7801' id='691' type-v2='text' w='35838' x='61678' y='88485'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Insight</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'>An increase in accidents tend to happen on </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>Friday</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'> at around </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#75a1c7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12'>3 PM</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#898989' fontsize='12'> (right after work).</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
